cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below, together with the paper it reproduces (see references)."
type: software
title: "caging_multirobot_ros2: cooperative object transport with two omnidirectional robots in ROS 2 and Gazebo"
abstract: >-
  A step-by-step ROS 2 Jazzy / Gazebo Harmonic reproduction of the caging-based
  multi-robot transport of Tejada et al. (2025): two mecanum robots with soft
  grippers approach, cage and carry an object with an LQR pose controller per
  robot and a Leader-Follower formation controller. Teaching material in 13
  steps (one tag per step) and a Docker image for students.
